# LOOM-8 demo: the weave's four rules, heard. A beat on T1; on T2 (felt piano) pattern A (a rising arpeggio, then
# a falling one) and pattern B (a syncopated line, other notes); then A woven with B: by bars (bar 1 A's, bar 2
# B's), by steps (odd steps A's, even B's), A's rhythm with B's notes, B's rhythm with A's notes. Two bars each, a
# scene each, the song plays them in turn. Factory sounds only (nothing private). Renders build/demos/weave/.
master 4096
bpm 110
# T1: a plain beat (kick, snare, closed hat)
hits 1 1 1 x.......x.......
hits 1 1 2 ....x.......x...
hits 1 1 3 x.x.x.x.x.x.x.x.
knob 1 level 80
# T2: felt piano, its own key (not the conductor's)
preset 2 rayon rayon
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 level 104
knob 2 send2 30
# A: eighths, C E G C up, then down, two bars
pat 2 1 32
notes 2 1 1 1.5 96 C4
notes 2 1 3 1.5 90 E4
notes 2 1 5 1.5 92 G4
notes 2 1 7 1.5 90 C5
notes 2 1 9 1.5 96 E5
notes 2 1 11 1.5 90 G5
notes 2 1 13 1.5 92 E5
notes 2 1 15 1.5 90 C5
notes 2 1 17 1.5 96 G4
notes 2 1 19 1.5 90 E4
notes 2 1 21 1.5 92 C4
notes 2 1 23 1.5 90 G3
notes 2 1 25 1.5 96 E3
notes 2 1 27 1.5 90 G3
notes 2 1 29 1.5 92 C4
notes 2 1 31 1.5 90 E4
# B: syncopated, A minor / F colours
pat 2 2 32
notes 2 2 1 2 110 A3
notes 2 2 4 2 100 D4
notes 2 2 7 1 96 F4
notes 2 2 8 2 100 A4
notes 2 2 11 3 110 G4
notes 2 2 15 1 90 F4
notes 2 2 17 2 110 D4
notes 2 2 20 2 100 F4
notes 2 2 23 1 96 A4
notes 2 2 24 2 100 C5
notes 2 2 27 3 110 B4
notes 2 2 31 1 90 G4
# the weaves (as SEL's WEAVE WITH COPIED makes them: A the pattern, B the copy)
weave 2 3 1 2 bars
weave 2 4 1 2 steps
weave 2 5 1 2 rhythm
weave 2 6 1 2 notes
# scenes: T2 plays A, B, then the four weaves
scenedef 1 1 1
scenedef 2 1 2
scenedef 3 1 3
scenedef 4 1 4
scenedef 5 1 5
scenedef 6 1 6
song 1:2 2:2 3:2 4:2 5:2 6:2
songloop 0
wait 300
# the Song page, PLAY: the song from slot 1; the screen on T2's Steps
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect page Song
tap PLAY
wav weave_demo.wav
wait 20
tap SEQ
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
shot f00.png
wait 1091
shot f01.png
wait 1091
tap OCT+
shot f02.png
wait 1011
shot f03.png
wait 1091
tap OCT-
shot f04.png
wait 1011
shot f05.png
wait 1091
tap OCT+
shot f06.png
wait 1011
shot f07.png
wait 1091
tap OCT-
shot f08.png
wait 1011
shot f09.png
wait 1091
tap OCT+
shot f10.png
wait 1011
shot f11.png
wait 1091
tap OCT-
shot f12.png
wait 1011
shot f13.png
wait 1091
tap OCT+
shot f14.png
wait 1011
shot f15.png
wait 1091
tap OCT-
shot f16.png
wait 1011
shot f17.png
wait 1091
tap OCT+
shot f18.png
wait 1011
shot f19.png
wait 1091
tap OCT-
shot f20.png
wait 1011
shot f21.png
wait 1091
tap OCT+
shot f22.png
wait 1011
shot f23.png
wait 1091
wait 1500
wavstop
